Lựa chọn:
- a. ReheapUp/ReheapDown: $O(log_2 n)$, Build a Heap: $O(log_2 n)$, Insert/Delete a Node: $O(log_2 n)$.
- b. ReheapUp/ReheapDown: $O(log_2 n)$, Build a Heap: $O(n log_2 n)$, Insert/Delete a Node: $O(log_2 n)$.
- c. ReheapUp/ReheapDown: $O(n log_2 n)$, Build a Heap: $O(lnog_2 n)$, Insert/Delete a Node: $O(n log_2 n)$.
- d. ReheapUp/ReheapDown: $O(log_2 n)$, Build a Heap: $O(n log_2 n)$, Insert/Delete a Node: $O(n log_2 n)$.', 1
);

